":"https://github.com/andrei-mart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":13150461970,"node_id":"RTE_lADOBlCVUc6L73GpzwAAAAMP1CAS","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/13150461970","actor":{"login":"andrei-mart","id":1223507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjM1MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1223507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart","html_url":"https://github.com/andrei-mart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"renamed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2024-06-13T17:19:52Z","rename":{"from":"[YSQL] Failure reported with BNL + IndexScan with CBO ","to":"[YSQL] In some rare cases YSQL attempts to fetch dropped column from DocDB "},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/2166416130","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/22832#issuecomment-2166416130","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/22832","id":2166416130,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc6BIOMC","user":{"login":"andrei-mart","id":1223507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjM1MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1223507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart","html_url":"https://github.com/andrei-mart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-06-13T17:38:36Z","updated_at":"2024-06-13T17:47:20Z","body":"The case reported is quite complex, there is easier repro:\r\n```\r\nyugabyte=# create table t1(k1 int, k2 int, v0 int, v1 int, v2 int, primary key ((k1, k2) hash));\r\nCREATE TABLE\r\nyugabyte=# alter table t1 drop column v0;\r\nALTER TABLE\r\nyugabyte=# create index on t1(k1, k2, v1); \r\nCREATE INDEX\r\nyugabyte=# set yb_pushdown_is_not_null to false;\r\nSET\r\nyugabyte=# select v2 from t1 where k1 = 1 and k2 > 0 and v1 in (1, 2);\r\nserver closed the connection unexpectedly\r\n        This probably means the server terminated abnormally\r\n        before or while processing the request.\r\nThe connection to the server was lost. Attempting reset: Succeeded.\r\n```\r\nIt is a code bug, where v1 column is supposed to be added to the fetch list, and column number in the index is used instead of the column number in the table, coincidentally the table has a dropped column in that position. In debug builds it triggers an assertion failure, in release it proceeds and fails because deleted columns have InvalidOid as the type Oid. Without deleted column it may have small performance impact, as column is unnecessarily fetched.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/2166416130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"andrei-mart","id":1223507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjM1MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1223507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart","html_url":"https://github.com/andrei-mart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":13167752602,"node_id":"LE_lADOBlCVUc6L